# The default local support model: Gemma 4 12B. Build it once in WSL:
#   ollama pull gemma4:12b
#   ollama create lumen-gemma -f ollama/lumen-gemma.Modelfile
# It followed the shop's rules best of the six models tried; see
# docs/local-model-tests.md. The other files here are the models it was
# compared with, kept so they can be rebuilt.
#
# Ollama's default 4096-token window is smaller than the system prompt, tools,
# a doc or two, and the chat history together, and Ollama silently drops the
# overflow. The OpenAI-compatible endpoint cannot change the window per request,
# so it is set here. Sampling stays at the publisher's defaults.
FROM gemma4:12b
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
